   * @x-autobe-specification Query shopping_mall_cart_items table by id with shopping_customer_id matching the authenticated customer's ID. Join with shopping_mall_product_variants to get variant details including sku_code, price (current), and deleted_at for availability. Further join with shopping_mall_products to get product name and base_price. Join with shopping_mall_sellers to get shop name. Calculate stock availability by summing shopping_mall_product_inventory_histories for the variant. Return error 404 if cart item not found or doesn't belong to customer. Include comparison between stored unit_price and current variant price to detect price changes.
